{"id":"ufwz9hngn744obffaotcbw4z6","title":"美国银行优先股投资者陷入亏损困境","originalTitle":"Buyers of $22 Billion Bank Securities Are Trapped in Losing Bet","summary":"自今年年初以来，220亿美元的美国银行优先股表现比最差的垃圾债券还要糟糕，投资者无法通过现有途径退出亏损头寸。这些固定利率优先股在疫情期间被出售，至今已下跌近40%，且所有发行方均未行使可让投资者免于亏损的还款选项。摩根士丹利即将作出的决定可能使这一局面更加恶化。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Bloomberg Markets"},"links":{"original":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-12/buyers-of-22-billion-bank-securities-are-trapped-in-losing-bet"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T11:45:46.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T11:58:21.511Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T11:58:21.511Z","category":"macro","tags":["数据发布"],"score":47,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Tasos Vossos","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"data","name":"数据发布"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}